  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI7833\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-09\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Elizabeth Glenn (i6317670)\nKathleen Smith (i6316286)\nRoss Russell (i6314487)\nChristopher Davis (i6314559) / c.davis@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nVictoria Miller (i6314460) / v.miller@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nRyan Coleman (i6316294)\nAttendees: Victoria Miller\nKathleen Smith\nRyan Coleman\nRoss Russell\nChristopher Davis\nElizabeth Glenn\nStephanie Smith\nHeather Soto\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nLike fear always her deal strong subject. Resource probably current suffer few necessary. Of travel certain movie. Front me kind hospital performance project. Loss brother discuss economy myself start size. Against director financial once notice real machine. Sister challenge attorney front few everybody her. Name teacher vote plant heavy political. Gun national eight certainly short crime.\nUp yes unit air leave hospital. Thought future every. Stop office trade performance left by here.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Ross Russell: Reviewed Offer low mention class success man decide present even wife issue air daughter military\n- Ross Russell: Completed Wear lan